<title>USA: Patriot Doubletree to buy hotel portfolio.</title>
<headline>Patriot Doubletree to buy hotel portfolio.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Patriot American Hospitality Inc and Doubletree Hotels Corp said on Wednesday that they agreed to acquire a five-hotel portfolio from Metropolitan Life Insurance Co for $153 million in cash and secured mortgage notes.</p>
<p>The portfolio includes the Doubletree at Houston's Allen Center, and the Tulsa Downtown Doubletree, which were both acquired in late 1996.</p>
<p>The three additional properties include Doubletree hotels owned by MetLife, located in Houston's Galleria area and in the Los Angeles and St Louis markets.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
